1
00:01:30,566 --> 00:01:31,551
=Tigers Sniff the Rose=

2
00:01:31,551 --> 00:01:33,560
(Based on the novel of the same name by Yiren Kuikui)

3
00:01:35,660 --> 00:01:38,260
=Episode 9=

4
00:01:55,760 --> 00:01:56,310
Your Highness!

5
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:58,209
When you went to Sigui Garden,

6
00:01:58,251 --> 00:01:59,171
didn't you take me with you?

7
00:01:59,950 --> 00:02:01,760
How could you leave without a word
and forget all about me?

8
00:02:02,280 --> 00:02:03,150
And Fang Tong!

9
00:02:03,510 --> 00:02:05,040
He just drove the carriage away
without a word.

10
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:06,510
I was scared out of my wits!

11
00:02:12,030 --> 00:02:13,680
If Liu Wenji hadn't been there...

12
00:02:15,750 --> 00:02:16,680
Exactly.

13
00:02:17,310 --> 00:02:18,590
You had Liu Wenji with you.

14
00:02:19,310 --> 00:02:20,590
If I'd called you away,

15
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,310
I'd have interrupted
a pair of lovebirds.

16
00:02:24,150 --> 00:02:25,070
Oh, come on!

17
00:02:25,710 --> 00:02:26,710
Your Highness, don't tease me.

18
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:30,150
Go scold Fang Tong instead.

19
00:02:30,840 --> 00:02:31,750
I want some peace and quiet.

20
00:02:40,750 --> 00:02:42,590
When I was young,

21
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,150
I too was full of ambition.

22
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:48,680
I vowed to serve a ruler who could
restore our nation's glory.

23
00:02:49,470 --> 00:02:50,680
Together, ruler and ministers

24
00:02:51,150 --> 00:02:52,960
would bring prosperity back to Huai,

25
00:02:54,030 --> 00:02:55,400
with nations coming from afar
to pay tribute,

26
00:02:55,630 --> 00:02:56,840
peace throughout the land,

27
00:02:57,280 --> 00:02:58,750
and happiness for the people.

28
00:03:00,310 --> 00:03:02,280
But then came the Rebellion
of the Seven Military Governors,

29
00:03:02,630 --> 00:03:04,680
and the people suffered terribly.

30
00:03:06,030 --> 00:03:08,910
Years of the court's efforts
were destroyed overnight.

31
00:03:09,800 --> 00:03:11,000
Though the rebellion was quelled,

32
00:03:11,800 --> 00:03:12,430
military power

33
00:03:13,080 --> 00:03:15,520
fell into Yu Cheng'an's hands.

34
00:03:17,150 --> 00:03:20,280
The eunuch faction
became a swarm of leeches,

35
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:22,590
feeding day and night

36
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:25,030
on the lifeblood of Huai.

37
00:03:28,750 --> 00:03:29,910
Our great cause remains unfinished.

38
00:03:30,590 --> 00:03:31,800
All our efforts have come to nothing.

39
00:03:32,710 --> 00:03:33,910
Yet His Majesty and I

40
00:03:34,470 --> 00:03:36,120
have both grown old.

41
00:03:36,680 --> 00:03:37,590
At court,

42
00:03:38,630 --> 00:03:40,710
everyone has their own agenda.

43
00:03:41,870 --> 00:03:44,190
They'll stop at nothing to seize power.

44
00:03:44,840 --> 00:03:47,870
Yet no one cares
about the common people.

45
00:04:17,680 --> 00:04:18,430
I concede defeat.

46
00:04:22,510 --> 00:04:23,630
You're still young.

47
00:04:24,000 --> 00:04:25,750
There's no shame in losing a few games.

48
00:04:26,560 --> 00:04:27,000
In time,

49
00:04:27,480 --> 00:04:28,720
you'll have plenty of room to improve.

50
00:04:29,430 --> 00:04:30,120
Thank you, sir.

51
00:04:30,680 --> 00:04:31,979
Don't thank me just yet.

52
00:04:32,021 --> 00:04:33,621
I'm the one asking you for a favor.

53
00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:36,040
Yan Shang,

54
00:04:36,800 --> 00:04:39,510
our nation is now ruled by traitors.

55
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:41,070
Inside and outside the court,

56
00:04:41,160 --> 00:04:44,750
it's full of beasts masquerading
as honorable men.

57
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:46,920
Have you considered this?

58
00:04:47,870 --> 00:04:49,720
If you leave Sheng'an today,

59
00:04:49,950 --> 00:04:52,680
the same tragedies will happen again,

60
00:04:53,120 --> 00:04:54,750
over and over, countless times.

61
00:04:55,680 --> 00:04:56,120
Yan Shang,

62
00:04:57,270 --> 00:04:59,040
is that really what you want?

63
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:04,390
No.

64
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:11,510
Look.

65
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:14,630
This is the gate of Sheng'an.

66
00:05:15,270 --> 00:05:16,430
Towering and imposing,

67
00:05:17,310 --> 00:05:18,160
yet when an army is defeated,

68
00:05:19,360 --> 00:05:20,680
it is as flimsy as paper.

69
00:05:22,430 --> 00:05:23,310
Beyond the gate,

70
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,830
a broad avenue stretches straight ahead.

71
00:05:25,360 --> 00:05:28,160
The people live along its sides,
and Taiji Palace stands at its end.

72
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:31,360
This is the heart of Huai.

73
00:05:31,680 --> 00:05:35,310
Nowhere else can one influence
the fate of the realm

74
00:05:35,750 --> 00:05:37,390
and shape the course of history
like here.

75
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:41,870
Yan Shang,

76
00:05:43,240 --> 00:05:44,680
you have extraordinary courage.

77
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:47,390
Enough to commit murder in Sheng'an,

78
00:05:48,190 --> 00:05:50,920
right under the Emperor's nose.

79
00:05:52,360 --> 00:05:53,360
And you're remarkably patient,

80
00:05:54,560 --> 00:05:57,480
able to lie low and scheme
without betraying a thing.

81
00:05:58,390 --> 00:06:00,240
So do you dare to stay

82
00:06:00,630 --> 00:06:03,800
and right the injustices of this world
with your own hands?

83
00:06:27,870 --> 00:06:28,800
Chancellor Liu,

84
00:06:30,480 --> 00:06:31,600
what should I do?

85
00:06:36,270 --> 00:06:36,950
Stay.

86
00:06:37,920 --> 00:06:38,870
Rise through the ranks.

87
00:06:39,510 --> 00:06:42,070
Until you hold the power to decide
who lives and dies,

88
00:06:42,680 --> 00:06:44,430
and determine the fate of Huai.

89
00:06:45,560 --> 00:06:46,070
Yan Shang,

90
00:06:46,830 --> 00:06:49,830
this road is long and treacherous.

91
00:06:50,830 --> 00:06:53,430
It may cost you your entire life,

92
00:06:53,870 --> 00:06:55,830
or even get you killed.

93
00:06:56,310 --> 00:06:58,040
Once you set foot on this path,

94
00:06:59,270 --> 00:07:00,190
no one will help you.

95
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:02,750
You must rely on your own abilities

96
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:06,000
to accomplish everything you aspire to.

97
00:07:06,360 --> 00:07:06,920
Succeed,

98
00:07:07,680 --> 00:07:09,750
and you'll destroy the traitors
and bring peace to the realm.

99
00:07:10,560 --> 00:07:11,120
Fail,

100
00:07:11,560 --> 00:07:13,920
and you won't even have a grave
to call your own.

101
00:07:21,310 --> 00:07:21,870
Well then.

102
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:24,120
Our game is finished,

103
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:26,160
and I've said all I have to say.

104
00:07:27,000 --> 00:07:28,630
Once you've decided which path to take,

105
00:07:29,510 --> 00:07:30,040
just go.

106
00:07:44,160 --> 00:07:45,070
Thank you, Chancellor.

107
00:07:47,060 --> 00:07:50,300
(Donghui Pavilion)

108
00:08:28,830 --> 00:08:30,040
(If my timing is right,)

109
00:08:31,430 --> 00:08:32,870
(he should be out of the city by now.)

110
00:08:37,270 --> 00:08:38,030
Your Highness! Your Highness!

111
00:08:39,670 --> 00:08:40,200
Your Highness.

112
00:08:40,510 --> 00:08:41,489
What is it now?

113
00:08:41,531 --> 00:08:42,691
Your Highness, Yan Shang is here.

114
00:09:08,150 --> 00:09:08,870
Greetings, Your Highness.

115
00:09:12,870 --> 00:09:13,720
I thought you'd left.

116
00:09:14,550 --> 00:09:15,360
Why have you come back?

117
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,670
Couldn't walk any farther?

118
00:09:19,240 --> 00:09:20,270
Come to borrow my carriage?

119
00:09:23,080 --> 00:09:24,030
I won't need a carriage just yet.

120
00:09:24,870 --> 00:09:26,390
But could I trouble you
for some hot water?

121
00:09:26,910 --> 00:09:27,790
I'd like to bathe and change

122
00:09:28,440 --> 00:09:29,550
before explaining myself.

123
00:09:32,270 --> 00:09:32,720
Chunhua.

124
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,080
Take him to get cleaned up.

125
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:41,630
Shang,

126
00:09:42,240 --> 00:09:43,550
did you quarrel with Her Highness again?

127
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,030
I wouldn't dare.

128
00:09:45,600 --> 00:09:46,440
I'll show you to the bathhouse.

129
00:09:48,630 --> 00:09:50,080
Will you need a change of clothes?

130
00:09:51,910 --> 00:09:52,670
I'm afraid so.

131
00:10:31,240 --> 00:10:31,750
Your Highness.

132
00:10:33,240 --> 00:10:33,720
Your Highness.

133
00:10:34,150 --> 00:10:35,080
Why are you hiding?

134
00:10:37,720 --> 00:10:38,200
Your Highness.

135
00:10:39,320 --> 00:10:40,030
What is it you need?

136
00:10:41,360 --> 00:10:42,870
I'm here to bring you some clothes.

137
00:10:44,750 --> 00:10:45,120
Well,

138
00:10:45,870 --> 00:10:47,270
thank you very much, then.

139
00:10:49,440 --> 00:10:51,120
Yan Shang, you're a strange one.

140
00:10:51,750 --> 00:10:53,360
You dare kill someone right
in front of me,

141
00:10:53,550 --> 00:10:55,000
but you're afraid to bathe
in front of me?

142
00:10:55,390 --> 00:10:56,910
Please give me a moment of privacy,
Your Highness,

143
00:10:57,750 --> 00:10:58,480
so I can get dressed.

144
00:11:14,840 --> 00:11:15,360
Yan Shang,

145
00:11:16,750 --> 00:11:17,960
how did you dare go through with it?

146
00:11:19,240 --> 00:11:20,600
There were so many people
at the festival today.

147
00:11:21,720 --> 00:11:22,510
One wrong move,

148
00:11:23,120 --> 00:11:24,120
and Zhang Renjing would've survived.

149
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:25,630
Your Highness,

150
00:11:26,630 --> 00:11:29,240
no plan in this world
is completely foolproof.

151
00:11:30,360 --> 00:11:31,720
Once I'd decided he had to die,

152
00:11:32,550 --> 00:11:34,440
even if he'd escaped this time,

153
00:11:35,440 --> 00:11:36,320
there would be another chance,

154
00:11:36,960 --> 00:11:37,790
and another after that.

155
00:11:41,840 --> 00:11:42,750
As long as I'm alive,

156
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:45,120
as long as I remain in Sheng'an,

157
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:47,120
sooner or later,

158
00:11:48,270 --> 00:11:49,440
he'll die by my hand.

159
00:11:52,080 --> 00:11:54,080
When I brought you here from Lingnan,

160
00:11:54,790 --> 00:11:55,550
I had no idea

161
00:11:55,910 --> 00:11:57,030
you'd turn out to be

162
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,480
such a vicious beast that never
lets go of its prey.

163
00:12:00,390 --> 00:12:01,550
Are you afraid of me, Your Highness?

164
00:12:02,200 --> 00:12:03,000
If I were afraid of you,

165
00:12:03,790 --> 00:12:04,529
you'd already be

166
00:12:04,571 --> 00:12:06,141
locked up in the Court
of Judicial Review's prison.

167
00:12:07,440 --> 00:12:08,000
Now tell me,

168
00:12:08,600 --> 00:12:09,510
why did you come back?

169
00:12:12,550 --> 00:12:13,150
I came back

170
00:12:13,630 --> 00:12:15,120
to take the imperial exams
and enter official service.

171
00:12:15,840 --> 00:12:16,840
I ask for your support, Your Highness.

172
00:12:19,150 --> 00:12:21,080
Did you hit your head outside the city

173
00:12:21,550 --> 00:12:22,440
and suddenly come to your senses?

174
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:25,120
You could say that.

175
00:12:35,440 --> 00:12:36,720
Why should I help you?

176
00:12:40,120 --> 00:12:40,840
I could

177
00:12:42,600 --> 00:12:44,240
tell you stories every night.

178
00:12:48,150 --> 00:12:48,720
Shang.

179
00:12:49,030 --> 00:12:50,390
You've got skin thicker

180
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,200
than the walls of Sheng'an.

181
00:12:54,960 --> 00:12:55,960
I'm not short of company,

182
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,720
nor am I afraid of nightmares.

183
00:12:59,120 --> 00:12:59,910
If that's all you have to offer,

184
00:13:01,270 --> 00:13:02,320
you won't be staying.

185
00:13:05,600 --> 00:13:07,630
I'm willing to fight the tiger
alongside you.

186
00:13:12,960 --> 00:13:13,510
What did you say?

187
00:13:14,910 --> 00:13:16,150
The person you seek revenge against...

188
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:17,720
Is it Yu Cheng'an,

189
00:13:18,480 --> 00:13:19,360
or someone else?

190
00:13:22,360 --> 00:13:23,720
I'm willing to stand by your side,

191
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:25,320
serve as your adviser,

192
00:13:25,600 --> 00:13:26,360
and become your right-hand man.

193
00:13:28,360 --> 00:13:30,000
Together, we'll bring down those
who deserve it.

194
00:13:33,440 --> 00:13:38,230
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

195
00:13:43,200 --> 00:13:44,150
Have you thought this through?

196
00:13:46,880 --> 00:13:52,470
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

197
00:13:58,150 --> 00:13:58,720
This time,

198
00:14:00,550 --> 00:14:02,000
I won't give you a chance
to change your mind.

199
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:03,270
This time,

200
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,030
I'm not leaving.

201
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:08,840
Yan Shang.

202
00:14:10,360 --> 00:14:11,000
I accept your offer.

203
00:14:11,960 --> 00:14:13,240
Do you know what I see in you?

204
00:14:15,750 --> 00:14:16,360
You have patience

205
00:14:16,910 --> 00:14:17,390
and ruthlessness.

206
00:14:19,360 --> 00:14:21,240
There are so many people I want dead.

207
00:14:22,240 --> 00:14:22,550
You

208
00:14:23,630 --> 00:14:24,720
will make a valuable ally.

209
00:14:27,510 --> 00:14:29,709
♪Not a single hour less♪

210
00:14:30,460 --> 00:14:36,900
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

211
00:14:37,190 --> 00:14:40,630
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

212
00:14:40,830 --> 00:14:44,299
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

213
00:14:44,540 --> 00:14:51,380
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

214
00:14:51,560 --> 00:14:53,199
♪- May time be free of fear
- Boats rock♪

215
00:14:53,241 --> 00:14:56,020
♪- May time be free of pain
- Lights fade, seasons turn♪

216
00:14:56,036 --> 00:14:58,496
♪You're the only one I need♪

217
00:14:59,870 --> 00:15:00,240
Yan Shang.

218
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:02,750
Today, you and I

219
00:15:03,600 --> 00:15:04,360
shall seal our pact by biting our arms.

220
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:07,120
From this day forward,

221
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:09,000
we stand or fall together,

222
00:15:10,030 --> 00:15:11,030
bound together in life and death.

223
00:15:28,600 --> 00:15:29,480
We seal our pact in blood,

224
00:15:30,630 --> 00:15:31,960
bound together in life and death.

225
00:15:31,960 --> 00:15:36,340
♪Let me hold you
whenever the rain falls♪

226
00:15:37,940 --> 00:15:40,340
♪Together we'll soar to the skies♪

227
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:42,000
You really bit hard!

228
00:15:53,150 --> 00:15:54,080
(Interrogation Chamber, Judicial Review)
Outside the private room,

229
00:15:55,030 --> 00:15:55,870
was he the only person you saw?

230
00:15:56,630 --> 00:15:57,150
Yes.

231
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:58,510
I wouldn't dare hide anything.

232
00:15:59,320 --> 00:16:00,870
That young man told me
to fetch some wine,

233
00:16:01,150 --> 00:16:02,030
so I went.

234
00:16:02,600 --> 00:16:03,240
When I returned,

235
00:16:03,840 --> 00:16:05,120
he... he'd already disappeared.

236
00:16:05,840 --> 00:16:06,480
And what

237
00:16:07,240 --> 00:16:07,870
did he look like?

238
00:16:08,600 --> 00:16:09,670
He was a young man,

239
00:16:10,150 --> 00:16:11,320
dressed in a white robe.

240
00:16:22,720 --> 00:16:23,240
I embroidered this.

241
00:16:24,240 --> 00:16:24,600
What do you think?

242
00:16:28,240 --> 00:16:29,200
Take a closer look.

243
00:16:37,440 --> 00:16:38,510
This waterweed...

244
00:16:39,720 --> 00:16:40,360
Sharp eyes.

245
00:16:41,360 --> 00:16:42,320
Do you know who these fish represent?

246
00:16:44,150 --> 00:16:45,150
Please enlighten me, Your Highness.

247
00:16:47,550 --> 00:16:48,440
The little one

248
00:16:48,910 --> 00:16:49,630
is Yu Xianyao,

249
00:16:50,120 --> 00:16:51,150
Yu Cheng'an's adopted son.

250
00:16:52,720 --> 00:16:54,840
(Yao)
He terrorizes Sheng'an,

251
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:55,750
committing every crime imaginable.

252
00:16:56,840 --> 00:16:58,360
(That's it! Hit him!)

253
00:16:58,360 --> 00:16:59,080
(Yu Xianyao, Yu Cheng'an's Adopted Son)

254
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:01,080
The one below is Zheng Xing,
a senior palace attendant.

255
00:17:01,720 --> 00:17:02,910
But he doesn't serve the Emperor.

256
00:17:03,270 --> 00:17:03,960
He serves Yu Cheng'an.

257
00:17:04,920 --> 00:17:06,480
He's Yu Cheng'an's shadow
inside the palace.

258
00:17:07,160 --> 00:17:09,270
He does all of Yu Cheng'an's dirty work.

259
00:17:13,540 --> 00:17:15,030
(Zheng Xing, Senior Palace Attendant)

260
00:17:15,030 --> 00:17:15,880
(Zheng Xing, Senior Palace Attendant)
The one on the right

261
00:17:16,200 --> 00:17:18,240
is Qiu Shuo, General of Tiger Might
in the Shence Army.

262
00:17:19,000 --> 00:17:20,160
When it comes to ferocity and courage,

263
00:17:20,590 --> 00:17:21,750
no one at court can match him.

264
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,000
What a shame that
such a formidable general

265
00:17:24,270 --> 00:17:25,680
has become Yu Cheng'an's guard dog.

266
00:17:26,960 --> 00:17:28,720
Whenever Yu Cheng'an goes out,

267
00:17:29,310 --> 00:17:31,070
Qiu Shuo personally leads
the Shence Army to guard him.

268
00:17:31,750 --> 00:17:33,030
So to kill Yu Cheng'an,

269
00:17:33,510 --> 00:17:34,680
(Qiu Shuo, General, Shence Army)
Qiu Shuo must die first.

270
00:17:35,640 --> 00:17:37,350
The one at the top is Wei Qiao.

271
00:17:38,110 --> 00:17:39,240
He holds no official degree,

272
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:41,510
yet he's Yu Cheng'an's
most trusted adviser.

273
00:17:42,480 --> 00:17:43,640
He's known as the Jade-Faced Fox,

274
00:17:44,400 --> 00:17:44,920
Wei Zidu.

275
00:17:46,820 --> 00:17:50,060
(Wei Qiao, Adviser to Yu Cheng'an)

276
00:17:55,720 --> 00:17:56,480
Wei Qiao...

277
00:17:57,640 --> 00:17:58,590
How is he related to Wei Shu?

278
00:17:58,920 --> 00:17:59,640
He's his older cousin.

279
00:18:05,030 --> 00:18:06,200
Then the biggest fish

280
00:18:06,640 --> 00:18:07,920
must be Yu Cheng'an himself.

281
00:18:21,680 --> 00:18:22,590
There certainly are

282
00:18:23,000 --> 00:18:23,790
a lot of people you want dead.

283
00:18:27,480 --> 00:18:28,590
If you're having second thoughts,

284
00:18:29,110 --> 00:18:29,590
it's too late.

285
00:18:30,440 --> 00:18:31,590
I'd have to kill you to keep you quiet.

286
00:18:33,720 --> 00:18:35,270
If you fear the weight
of all this bloodshed,

287
00:18:36,350 --> 00:18:37,640
recite a few more sutras.

288
00:18:39,750 --> 00:18:41,030
No sacred scripture
can save either of us.

289
00:18:41,790 --> 00:18:42,830
If a hell of blood awaits us,

290
00:18:43,750 --> 00:18:44,400
I'll descend into it with you.

291
00:18:49,270 --> 00:18:49,680
Your Highness,

292
00:18:51,200 --> 00:18:52,200
may I ask you something?

293
00:18:53,110 --> 00:18:54,720
If you think it'll make me angry,

294
00:18:55,070 --> 00:18:55,680
don't bother.

295
00:18:57,160 --> 00:18:58,550
Why do you trust me, Your Highness?

296
00:19:01,000 --> 00:19:01,480
Yan Shang,

297
00:19:01,880 --> 00:19:02,640
you're mistaken.

298
00:19:03,590 --> 00:19:04,830
I swore an oath of allegiance with you

299
00:19:05,110 --> 00:19:06,110
and explained this embroidery to you

300
00:19:07,160 --> 00:19:08,590
only because we can be useful
to each other.

301
00:19:08,920 --> 00:19:09,680
It makes us suitable allies.

302
00:19:11,400 --> 00:19:13,590
Besides, you're a murderer now.

303
00:19:14,510 --> 00:19:16,160
Where else can you go

304
00:19:16,350 --> 00:19:17,200
but stay right here by my side?

305
00:19:18,790 --> 00:19:19,550
So,

306
00:19:20,270 --> 00:19:21,310
I don't trust you,

307
00:19:22,270 --> 00:19:23,200
and you needn't trust me either.

308
00:19:23,790 --> 00:19:24,920
If one day,

309
00:19:25,480 --> 00:19:26,350
we're both still alive

310
00:19:26,550 --> 00:19:28,030
and have accomplished everything
we set out to do,

311
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:29,480
then

312
00:19:30,680 --> 00:19:31,680
we can part on good terms.

313
00:19:36,750 --> 00:19:38,160
But for now,

314
00:19:39,030 --> 00:19:40,680
we're allies in the same boat.

315
00:19:41,750 --> 00:19:42,720
Sheng'an is full of prying eyes.

316
00:19:44,880 --> 00:19:46,830
I need to give you an official place
in my household,

317
00:19:47,640 --> 00:19:48,960
so you can stay by my side

318
00:19:49,640 --> 00:19:50,510
without arousing suspicion.

319
00:19:54,880 --> 00:19:55,830
An official place?

320
00:19:59,920 --> 00:20:00,510
From now on,

321
00:20:01,110 --> 00:20:02,920
you'll officially be my male favorite.

322
00:20:03,960 --> 00:20:04,880
If you're too thin-skinned

323
00:20:05,270 --> 00:20:06,880
to endure the gossip
whenever you come and go,

324
00:20:07,720 --> 00:20:08,590
you might as well quit now.

325
00:20:14,160 --> 00:20:15,550
I'm honored by your favor,
Your Highness.

326
00:20:17,240 --> 00:20:17,960
Of course.

327
00:20:26,820 --> 00:20:29,220
(Princess Danyang's Residence)

328
00:20:29,680 --> 00:20:30,249
Wenji, what's wrong?

329
00:20:30,291 --> 00:20:30,661
Chunhua.

330
00:20:33,920 --> 00:20:34,200
Come here.

331
00:20:38,270 --> 00:20:39,200
Is Yan Shang here?

332
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:40,350
Yes.

333
00:20:40,830 --> 00:20:41,510
Are you looking for him?

334
00:20:41,790 --> 00:20:42,400
I'll go get him.

335
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:44,440
Thank goodness.

336
00:20:44,790 --> 00:20:45,920
He was right to come here.

337
00:20:47,720 --> 00:20:49,350
A group of officers from the Court
of Judicial Review

338
00:20:49,640 --> 00:20:51,200
just burst into the place
Yan Shang and I share

339
00:20:51,510 --> 00:20:52,550
and searched it from top to bottom.

340
00:20:53,400 --> 00:20:55,590
They said they wanted to take him in
for questioning.

341
00:20:56,350 --> 00:20:57,790
I rushed to the Imperial Academy
to find him,

342
00:20:58,240 --> 00:20:59,110
but he wasn't there.

343
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,440
The only other place I could think of

344
00:21:01,030 --> 00:21:02,000
was the princess's residence.

345
00:21:03,960 --> 00:21:05,590
What does the Court want with Yan Shang?

346
00:21:06,030 --> 00:21:06,920
I have no idea.

347
00:21:08,030 --> 00:21:09,590
Could you please let him know?

348
00:21:10,790 --> 00:21:11,350
Don't worry.

349
00:21:11,680 --> 00:21:12,590
I'll tell him right away.

350
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:19,440
Officers have already searched
Yongshou Temple.

351
00:21:19,830 --> 00:21:21,160
They're searching everywhere
for Yan Shang.

352
00:21:23,590 --> 00:21:25,590
Did they say who ordered his arrest?

353
00:21:26,920 --> 00:21:27,350
No.

354
00:21:31,200 --> 00:21:32,440
Send Fang Tong to the Court
of Judicial Review.

355
00:21:32,830 --> 00:21:33,350
Tell him to find Yang Si

356
00:21:34,200 --> 00:21:35,400
and have him come see me here.

357
00:21:47,480 --> 00:21:48,400
Thank goodness you're safe.

358
00:21:48,790 --> 00:21:49,859
The murderer hadn't been caught,

359
00:21:49,901 --> 00:21:50,661
and you'd disappeared.

360
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:52,590
Only later did I hear

361
00:21:52,790 --> 00:21:53,830
you'd taken a carriage home.

362
00:21:54,550 --> 00:21:55,110
Murderer?

363
00:21:56,480 --> 00:21:57,160
What murderer?

364
00:21:58,720 --> 00:21:59,880
The one who stabbed Zhang Renjing
to death.

365
00:22:00,510 --> 00:22:01,750
Wasn't it Grand Princess Luling?

366
00:22:02,550 --> 00:22:03,000
No.

367
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:04,960
Luling only stabbed him once.

368
00:22:05,590 --> 00:22:07,310
Someone else inflicted
the fatal wounds afterward.

369
00:22:08,480 --> 00:22:09,270
I suspect...

370
00:22:09,830 --> 00:22:10,510
I was the one who stabbed him.

371
00:22:12,790 --> 00:22:13,160
What?

372
00:22:13,960 --> 00:22:15,350
I'm the one who stabbed
that brute to death.

373
00:22:15,790 --> 00:22:16,960
Are you taking me to the authorities?

374
00:22:23,510 --> 00:22:24,350
Oh, I almost forgot.

375
00:22:25,350 --> 00:22:26,110
You are the authorities.

376
00:22:28,310 --> 00:22:30,270
Wanyao, this is no joking matter!

377
00:22:30,750 --> 00:22:31,680
A man's life is at stake.

378
00:22:46,640 --> 00:22:47,590
This is the knife that killed him.

379
00:22:53,790 --> 00:22:54,720
Why do you have a knife?

380
00:22:55,440 --> 00:22:56,480
Where did you buy it?

381
00:22:57,200 --> 00:22:58,350
How would I know?

382
00:22:59,720 --> 00:23:00,790
Who said it was mine?

383
00:23:02,030 --> 00:23:03,000
It belonged to that brute.

384
00:23:03,830 --> 00:23:04,880
He pulled it from his sleeve

385
00:23:05,640 --> 00:23:06,640
and lunged straight at me.

386
00:23:07,270 --> 00:23:08,200
I managed to wrestle it from him

387
00:23:08,640 --> 00:23:09,200
and stabbed him to death.

388
00:23:09,960 --> 00:23:10,680
You encountered him?

389
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:11,550
Of course I did.

390
00:23:16,310 --> 00:23:16,680
No.

391
00:23:18,200 --> 00:23:18,550
Wanyao,

392
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:19,440
tell me,

393
00:23:20,240 --> 00:23:21,070
how exactly did you kill him?

394
00:23:21,550 --> 00:23:22,640
Where did you stab him? How many times?

395
00:23:24,030 --> 00:23:24,480
Yang Si.

396
00:23:25,680 --> 00:23:26,640
Why don't you just put me in chains

397
00:23:27,310 --> 00:23:28,440
and torture me at the Court
of Judicial Review?

398
00:23:29,310 --> 00:23:30,640
You rushed off in such a hurry.

399
00:23:31,590 --> 00:23:32,830
I was left hiding alone, terrified.

400
00:23:33,440 --> 00:23:34,830
Then that man suddenly lunged at me.

401
00:23:35,480 --> 00:23:36,880
I was lucky enough to fight back.

402
00:23:37,750 --> 00:23:39,200
How could I remember exactly
how I killed him?

403
00:23:40,160 --> 00:23:42,000
I don't even know what made that brute
so bold

404
00:23:42,510 --> 00:23:44,590
that he dared attack me
despite his injuries.

405
00:23:45,440 --> 00:23:48,030
The coroner found alcohol
and aphrodisiacs in his stomach.

406
00:23:50,240 --> 00:23:51,680
He was probably out of his mind.

407
00:23:57,750 --> 00:23:58,790
His body was covered in severe wounds.

408
00:23:59,400 --> 00:23:59,680
You...

409
00:24:03,240 --> 00:24:04,030
Where are your bloodstained clothes?

410
00:24:04,510 --> 00:24:05,720
Can you show them to me?

411
00:24:06,310 --> 00:24:06,790
I burned them.

412
00:24:07,590 --> 00:24:08,880
Why would I keep something so cursed?

413
00:24:16,270 --> 00:24:16,830
There's something else.

414
00:24:18,510 --> 00:24:19,070
Chunhua,

415
00:24:19,640 --> 00:24:21,400
fetch my cloak from the carriage.

416
00:24:36,590 --> 00:24:37,920
Why didn't you tell me?

417
00:24:38,070 --> 00:24:39,200
Because you were on official duty.

418
00:24:40,030 --> 00:24:41,160
You had criminals to catch!

419
00:24:42,720 --> 00:24:43,680
When I encountered that man,

420
00:24:44,070 --> 00:24:45,110
where were you?

421
00:24:46,030 --> 00:24:47,070
When my life was in danger,

422
00:24:47,680 --> 00:24:48,830
what else could I do but fight
for my life?

423
00:24:49,160 --> 00:24:50,590
Was I supposed to count
on you to save me?

424
00:24:53,790 --> 00:24:54,830
I was terrified

425
00:24:55,720 --> 00:24:56,720
and accidentally stabbed him to death.

426
00:24:57,270 --> 00:24:58,270
I didn't dare tell anyone

427
00:24:58,750 --> 00:25:00,000
and hurried into my carriage.

428
00:25:00,920 --> 00:25:01,830
Imagine the rumors
if people learned that

429
00:25:02,550 --> 00:25:04,680
the man who assaulted Grand Princess
Luling had come after me too.

430
00:25:05,160 --> 00:25:06,160
What would they say about me?

431
00:25:11,720 --> 00:25:12,400
But then again,

432
00:25:14,070 --> 00:25:15,750
I'm hardly a model of chastity.

433
00:25:17,830 --> 00:25:19,110
My reputation as a woman

434
00:25:19,880 --> 00:25:20,830
could hardly get any worse.

435
00:25:21,400 --> 00:25:22,329
No, that's not...

436
00:25:22,371 --> 00:25:23,021
Not what?

437
00:25:24,510 --> 00:25:25,750
Not a widow returned from a marriage
far away?

438
00:25:26,680 --> 00:25:27,200
Or

439
00:25:28,680 --> 00:25:29,960
not a murderer?

440
00:25:37,920 --> 00:25:38,510
Back then,

441
00:25:38,880 --> 00:25:40,200
I actually left you alone.

442
00:25:43,400 --> 00:25:43,790
Come on.

443
00:25:45,030 --> 00:25:45,769
Let's go to the Court
of Judicial Review together.

444
00:25:45,811 --> 00:25:46,181
No!

445
00:25:46,830 --> 00:25:47,240
Wanyao.

446
00:25:47,680 --> 00:25:48,680
I'll pretend I never came here today.

447
00:25:49,550 --> 00:25:51,030
Other than me,

448
00:25:51,400 --> 00:25:52,750
you mustn't tell another soul.

449
00:25:53,240 --> 00:25:53,880
Of course.

450
00:25:54,200 --> 00:25:55,160
I'm not a fool.

451
00:25:57,070 --> 00:25:57,790
That brute

452
00:25:58,160 --> 00:25:59,480
was a captain in the Shence Army,

453
00:26:00,550 --> 00:26:02,240
an old subordinate Yu Cheng'an
recently brought to the capital.

454
00:26:03,310 --> 00:26:05,550
I'm afraid the Shence Army
won't let this go.

455
00:26:06,480 --> 00:26:06,920
Don't worry.

456
00:26:07,270 --> 00:26:08,000
I'll find a way.

457
00:26:13,440 --> 00:26:14,790
So he was one of Yu Cheng'an's men.

458
00:26:18,000 --> 00:26:18,590
I have my own way.

459
00:26:19,160 --> 00:26:20,350
No need to trouble you, Assessor Yang.

460
00:26:21,510 --> 00:26:22,160
What way?

461
00:26:25,270 --> 00:26:25,920
I won't see you out.

462
00:27:07,480 --> 00:27:07,830
Your Highness.

463
00:27:19,680 --> 00:27:21,000
That childhood sweetheart of yours...

464
00:27:23,310 --> 00:27:25,030
You've only just become
my male favorite,

465
00:27:26,110 --> 00:27:27,200
and you're already jealous?

466
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:28,790
Just now,

467
00:27:29,830 --> 00:27:30,550
when he saw me,

468
00:27:31,310 --> 00:27:32,750
he looked rather strange.

469
00:27:34,240 --> 00:27:35,030
He's now

470
00:27:35,830 --> 00:27:37,000
an assessor at the Court
of Judicial Review.

471
00:27:37,750 --> 00:27:38,920
He's investigating Zhang Renjing's
murder.

472
00:27:43,480 --> 00:27:44,480
Don't worry.

473
00:27:44,830 --> 00:27:46,550
You belong to me now.

474
00:27:47,110 --> 00:27:48,160
Of course I'll protect you.

475
00:27:49,160 --> 00:27:49,960
This matter

476
00:27:50,510 --> 00:27:51,480
is no longer your concern.

477
00:27:53,550 --> 00:27:54,400
Still, it's a murder case.

478
00:27:54,880 --> 00:27:55,510
For the next few days,

479
00:27:56,000 --> 00:27:56,920
don't leave the residence.

480
00:27:58,720 --> 00:28:00,310
If someone recognizes your face,

481
00:28:00,750 --> 00:28:02,680
they might remember something
that incriminates you.

482
00:28:03,640 --> 00:28:03,960
Also,

483
00:28:05,310 --> 00:28:06,920
tell me exactly what happened,

484
00:28:07,510 --> 00:28:10,440
from beginning to end.
Don't leave out a single detail.

485
00:28:11,680 --> 00:28:12,720
Then stay here.

486
00:28:13,920 --> 00:28:14,720
As for me,

487
00:28:16,070 --> 00:28:17,110
I have a relative to visit.

488
00:28:23,000 --> 00:28:24,440
By the time I came to my senses,

489
00:28:26,510 --> 00:28:28,510
the man was already lying on the ground,

490
00:28:29,680 --> 00:28:31,830
dead from my stab wounds.

491
00:28:33,270 --> 00:28:34,000
Aunt.

492
00:28:35,000 --> 00:28:36,000
Why must you and I

493
00:28:36,830 --> 00:28:39,200
suffer such terrible misfortunes?

494
00:28:40,640 --> 00:28:41,880
He wasn't just brazen.

495
00:28:42,790 --> 00:28:43,720
He must've been insane!

496
00:28:45,550 --> 00:28:47,400
I heard from the court officials

497
00:28:49,000 --> 00:28:50,790
that he'd taken a large dose
of aphrodisiacs

498
00:28:51,750 --> 00:28:53,550
and was terribly drunk.

499
00:28:54,000 --> 00:28:55,270
He'd lost his senses,

500
00:28:55,480 --> 00:28:57,440
which is why he stumbled
into the private room.

501
00:28:57,960 --> 00:28:58,510
Aunt,

502
00:28:59,030 --> 00:29:01,000
what if word of this gets out?

503
00:29:02,110 --> 00:29:03,400
So what if it does?

504
00:29:04,070 --> 00:29:05,310
You think I'm afraid of gossip?

505
00:29:06,310 --> 00:29:06,750
But...

506
00:29:08,070 --> 00:29:08,880
His wounds...

507
00:29:09,680 --> 00:29:11,510
We were the ones who stabbed him.

508
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:13,400
After all,

509
00:29:14,440 --> 00:29:16,270
a man is dead!

510
00:29:17,590 --> 00:29:18,350
Aunt!

511
00:29:18,830 --> 00:29:21,790
I've never killed anyone before!

512
00:29:23,400 --> 00:29:24,440
There, there.

513
00:29:24,750 --> 00:29:26,440
That's enough, Wanyao.

514
00:29:27,030 --> 00:29:28,400
Stop crying.

515
00:29:30,030 --> 00:29:31,030
You're a princess.

516
00:29:31,640 --> 00:29:32,680
Have some dignity.

517
00:29:34,000 --> 00:29:35,830
I say you did well to kill him.

518
00:29:36,550 --> 00:29:37,550
In fact, I should thank you

519
00:29:37,920 --> 00:29:39,350
for avenging the insult I suffered.

520
00:29:40,920 --> 00:29:42,510
I only wish I'd been there.

521
00:29:42,720 --> 00:29:44,590
I'd have hacked him to pieces myself!

522
00:29:47,070 --> 00:29:48,440
Hearing you say that, Aunt,

523
00:29:49,160 --> 00:29:49,880
I suddenly

524
00:29:50,720 --> 00:29:52,200
feel so much better.

525
00:29:54,030 --> 00:29:56,270
Come to think of it, you and I

526
00:29:56,880 --> 00:29:58,510
have rid the people of a menace.

527
00:29:59,590 --> 00:30:00,920
Exactly.

528
00:30:05,400 --> 00:30:06,240
But...

529
00:30:09,960 --> 00:30:10,680
But...

530
00:30:11,350 --> 00:30:13,000
I heard from the court officials

531
00:30:14,160 --> 00:30:14,790
that the man

532
00:30:15,550 --> 00:30:17,240
was one of Lord Yu's subordinates.

533
00:30:18,830 --> 00:30:19,640
Aunt,

534
00:30:20,480 --> 00:30:22,270
won't that make things difficult?

535
00:30:23,720 --> 00:30:24,440
Wanyao,

536
00:30:25,510 --> 00:30:27,200
you really underestimate me.

537
00:30:27,790 --> 00:30:28,720
What's the big deal?

538
00:30:30,270 --> 00:30:31,200
So what if I killed

539
00:30:31,680 --> 00:30:33,070
a mere captain today?

540
00:30:33,480 --> 00:30:35,750
Even if I killed a general tomorrow,

541
00:30:36,750 --> 00:30:37,920
what of it?

542
00:30:46,680 --> 00:30:47,510
Wanyao claims

543
00:30:48,200 --> 00:30:49,240
she killed Zhang Renjing.

544
00:30:50,750 --> 00:30:51,200
Do you believe her?

545
00:30:53,680 --> 00:30:55,350
But she had the murder weapon
and bloodstained clothes.

546
00:30:56,270 --> 00:30:56,880
You don't believe her either,

547
00:30:57,830 --> 00:30:58,160
do you?

548
00:30:59,350 --> 00:31:00,480
No matter how reckless
Zhang Renjing was,

549
00:31:01,030 --> 00:31:01,920
or how drunk and drugged he was,

550
00:31:02,680 --> 00:31:03,550
he was still a seasoned soldier

551
00:31:03,960 --> 00:31:05,440
who'd survived years of fighting.

552
00:31:06,310 --> 00:31:07,480
He slept with one eye open.

553
00:31:08,790 --> 00:31:09,960
He was wounded and fleeing for his life.

554
00:31:10,550 --> 00:31:11,489
I refuse to believe he'd be

555
00:31:11,531 --> 00:31:13,331
so blinded by lust that he'd act
so recklessly.

556
00:31:14,440 --> 00:31:15,070
And Wanyao

557
00:31:15,790 --> 00:31:16,920
isn't someone who would commit murder.

558
00:31:18,640 --> 00:31:19,510
It's not that she lacks courage.

559
00:31:20,270 --> 00:31:21,480
But murder is a serious matter,

560
00:31:22,160 --> 00:31:23,240
and she'd never willingly

561
00:31:23,790 --> 00:31:25,030
get herself tangled up in such trouble.

562
00:31:26,240 --> 00:31:26,960
Then why would she...

563
00:31:28,030 --> 00:31:29,160
That's the real question.

564
00:31:31,000 --> 00:31:31,790
We need to figure out

565
00:31:32,880 --> 00:31:34,070
why she's lying.

566
00:31:36,030 --> 00:31:36,920
Or rather,

567
00:31:38,550 --> 00:31:40,000
who exactly is she trying to protect?

568
00:31:46,960 --> 00:31:47,270
Your Highness.

569
00:31:48,270 --> 00:31:48,640
Your Highness.

570
00:31:50,400 --> 00:31:50,750
Get out.

571
00:31:51,270 --> 00:31:51,640
Get out.

572
00:31:53,510 --> 00:31:53,960
Your Highness.

573
00:31:55,350 --> 00:31:55,750
I...

574
00:31:56,350 --> 00:31:56,830
I deserve punishment.

575
00:31:57,960 --> 00:31:59,640
Thank goodness you weren't hurt.

576
00:32:02,960 --> 00:32:04,240
I wasn't physically hurt,

577
00:32:05,160 --> 00:32:06,590
but I was frightened!

578
00:32:06,680 --> 00:32:08,030
And utterly disgusted!

579
00:32:08,640 --> 00:32:09,160
You...

580
00:32:09,350 --> 00:32:11,200
You certainly promoted
a fine subordinate!

581
00:32:12,110 --> 00:32:12,510
I...

582
00:32:13,000 --> 00:32:13,960
I deserve to die a thousand deaths!

583
00:32:37,110 --> 00:32:37,590
I want some tea.

584
00:32:41,480 --> 00:32:41,790
Yes.

585
00:32:43,440 --> 00:32:43,750
Right away.

586
00:33:15,790 --> 00:33:16,979
Hurry up!

587
00:33:17,021 --> 00:33:17,461
Yes.

588
00:33:23,480 --> 00:33:27,350
I truly misjudged the man,

589
00:33:27,830 --> 00:33:29,350
and you suffered because of it.

590
00:33:32,550 --> 00:33:34,200
Wanyao told me today

591
00:33:34,510 --> 00:33:35,200
that the dead man's body

592
00:33:35,750 --> 00:33:37,510
is still being held by the Court
of Judicial Review,

593
00:33:37,830 --> 00:33:38,880
while they investigate
every little thing.

594
00:33:41,070 --> 00:33:42,880
Princess Danyang
is very thoughtful indeed.

595
00:33:44,160 --> 00:33:44,640
Rest assured.

596
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:46,459
I'll send someone
to the Court tomorrow...

597
00:33:46,501 --> 00:33:47,221
Tomorrow?

598
00:33:48,830 --> 00:33:49,240
Tonight!

599
00:33:50,720 --> 00:33:51,200
Right now!

600
00:33:51,790 --> 00:33:52,769
I'll send someone
to the court immediately

601
00:33:52,811 --> 00:33:54,051
and have that corpse brought back.

602
00:33:54,440 --> 00:33:55,400
Bring it back?

603
00:33:58,270 --> 00:33:59,160
Grind its bones to dust
and scatter the ashes?

604
00:34:00,110 --> 00:34:01,240
Yes! Grind its bones to dust!

605
00:34:01,550 --> 00:34:02,310
I promise you,

606
00:34:02,720 --> 00:34:03,960
this case will be closed.

607
00:34:04,160 --> 00:34:04,859
From now on,

608
00:34:04,901 --> 00:34:06,811
no one will ever mention
this matter to you again

609
00:34:07,790 --> 00:34:08,550
or cause you any distress.

610
00:34:14,840 --> 00:34:15,440
I'll be leaving, then.

611
00:34:16,760 --> 00:34:17,480
Leaving so soon?

612
00:34:20,360 --> 00:34:21,400
Lord Yu, you're a busy man.

613
00:34:22,000 --> 00:34:23,590
Who am I to impose on you?

614
00:34:25,280 --> 00:34:25,710
Your Highness,

615
00:34:26,920 --> 00:34:28,920
why must you speak to me like that?

616
00:34:45,230 --> 00:34:45,590
Oh, one more thing.

617
00:34:46,230 --> 00:34:47,920
The imperial exams are in a few days.

618
00:34:48,760 --> 00:34:50,230
Once the top three candidates
are decided,

619
00:34:50,400 --> 00:34:51,360
before the results are posted,

620
00:34:52,400 --> 00:34:53,400
I want to see the list first.

621
00:34:54,760 --> 00:34:57,150
Since when have you cared about
selecting officials for the court?

622
00:34:58,760 --> 00:35:00,360
That's hardly what interests me!

623
00:35:02,110 --> 00:35:03,110
Why are you following me?

624
00:35:03,440 --> 00:35:04,920
Go grind those bones to dust!

625
00:35:06,000 --> 00:35:06,400
Yes.

626
00:35:08,630 --> 00:35:10,070
Farewell, Your Highness!

627
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:53,000
Careful, Your Highness.

628
00:35:54,400 --> 00:35:55,230
You should sit farther inside.

629
00:35:56,550 --> 00:35:57,800
We're on the grounds of my residence.

630
00:35:58,800 --> 00:36:01,320
I've ridden this little boat
countless times.

631
00:36:02,550 --> 00:36:04,840
I often take it out just
to drift around.

632
00:36:05,360 --> 00:36:05,960
Don't worry.

633
00:36:22,540 --> 00:36:29,530
♪Playing out life's game, forever by
your side; Innocent years drift by♪

634
00:36:31,260 --> 00:36:38,080
♪I thought time might stand still
forever at that crossroads♪

635
00:36:39,620 --> 00:36:46,610
♪Watching flowers bloom and fade;
weathering life's rise and fall♪

636
00:36:47,870 --> 00:36:54,820
♪Turns out, unspoken tenderness
is starlight caught in your eyes♪

637
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:22,190
Your Highness.

638
00:37:23,000 --> 00:37:23,590
Where are we?

639
00:37:24,880 --> 00:37:26,190
If you're going out this late,

640
00:37:26,800 --> 00:37:27,800
you should bring more guards.

641
00:37:28,400 --> 00:37:29,960
Stop worrying over nothing.

642
00:37:30,360 --> 00:37:31,280
There's nobody around.

643
00:38:03,000 --> 00:38:03,440
Not bad.

644
00:38:04,280 --> 00:38:05,320
It's a little small,

645
00:38:05,960 --> 00:38:07,320
but it's been kept quite clean.

646
00:38:09,030 --> 00:38:10,800
This place is connected to your
residence by waterway.

647
00:38:11,400 --> 00:38:12,480
Is it another of your
private properties?

648
00:38:14,000 --> 00:38:14,880
It used to be mine.

649
00:38:15,400 --> 00:38:16,760
Now it's yours.

650
00:38:18,110 --> 00:38:19,000
Isn't that only natural?

651
00:38:20,320 --> 00:38:21,110
To be frank,

652
00:38:21,440 --> 00:38:22,360
a residence this large

653
00:38:23,030 --> 00:38:24,880
requires servants
and considerable upkeep.

654
00:38:25,760 --> 00:38:26,480
I can't afford...

655
00:38:27,150 --> 00:38:27,710
Yan Shang.

656
00:38:28,230 --> 00:38:30,110
I've never seen anyone so poor yet
bold enough to come to the capital,

657
00:38:30,480 --> 00:38:31,630
and so shameless

658
00:38:31,960 --> 00:38:32,840
on top of that.

659
00:38:34,670 --> 00:38:35,360
You're too kind, Your Highness.

660
00:38:35,920 --> 00:38:36,510
That's easily solved.

661
00:38:37,190 --> 00:38:38,280
I have plenty of servants.

662
00:38:38,710 --> 00:38:39,710
I'll lend you a few.

663
00:38:40,880 --> 00:38:41,320
But...

664
00:38:42,480 --> 00:38:43,630
remember to write me an IOU.

665
00:38:47,960 --> 00:38:48,800
Anything more you want to say?

666
00:38:53,760 --> 00:38:54,840
Yan Shang, do you want it or not?

667
00:38:58,880 --> 00:38:59,630
If I say no,

668
00:39:00,030 --> 00:39:01,280
I'm afraid you'll slap me again.

669
00:39:01,880 --> 00:39:03,230
I'll speak to Wenji tomorrow

670
00:39:03,550 --> 00:39:04,800
and ask him to bring my belongings here.

671
00:39:05,840 --> 00:39:06,440
Thank you, Your Highness.

672
00:39:07,190 --> 00:39:09,000
I'll probably need to
borrow from you a lot.

673
00:39:09,800 --> 00:39:11,590
I hope you'll be generous
with the repayment deadlines.

674
00:39:13,190 --> 00:39:15,920
Didn't you say you had no way
to repay me?

675
00:39:17,190 --> 00:39:19,440
Looking you over,

676
00:39:20,550 --> 00:39:21,710
that mouth is your only real asset.

677
00:39:22,360 --> 00:39:22,840
Make sure

678
00:39:23,360 --> 00:39:24,360
you put it to good use.

679
00:39:40,840 --> 00:39:41,670
What I mean is,

680
00:39:42,400 --> 00:39:43,569
say more sweet things

681
00:39:43,611 --> 00:39:44,651
and tell interesting stories.

682
00:40:05,510 --> 00:40:06,630
I rarely visit this residence.

683
00:40:07,840 --> 00:40:08,630
Looking at it tonight,

684
00:40:09,440 --> 00:40:10,960
it feels so cold and desolate.

685
00:40:12,440 --> 00:40:13,440
If it makes you uncomfortable,

686
00:40:13,880 --> 00:40:14,960
I'll have someone come tomorrow

687
00:40:15,670 --> 00:40:16,590
to cut down all these trees

688
00:40:17,150 --> 00:40:17,760
and replace them with flowers.

689
00:40:18,510 --> 00:40:19,440
There's no need, Your Highness.

690
00:40:20,230 --> 00:40:21,280
I like this residence very much.

691
00:40:22,110 --> 00:40:23,030
Pine breezes, moonlit shadows...

692
00:40:23,480 --> 00:40:24,230
A sight of cool serenity.

693
00:40:25,710 --> 00:40:26,630
Sheng'an is such a bustling city.

694
00:40:27,440 --> 00:40:28,840
It's rare to find such
a peaceful retreat.

695
00:40:35,110 --> 00:40:35,480
Your Highness.

696
00:40:37,960 --> 00:40:38,320
Your Highness.

697
00:40:40,800 --> 00:40:43,400
The former owner of this residence
rose to the rank of chancellor,

698
00:40:44,760 --> 00:40:46,000
but he angered Yu Cheng'an

699
00:40:46,510 --> 00:40:47,000
and was eventually

700
00:40:47,880 --> 00:40:48,880
cut in half and left on public display.

701
00:40:51,590 --> 00:40:52,760
No wonder it's so chilling here.

702
00:40:53,360 --> 00:40:53,920
Turns out

703
00:40:54,630 --> 00:40:55,670
it's a haunted house.

704
00:40:59,070 --> 00:40:59,510
Scared?

705
00:41:02,510 --> 00:41:03,630
Since Lord Yu came to power,

706
00:41:04,320 --> 00:41:06,480
he's purged court officials
time and again.

707
00:41:07,760 --> 00:41:09,760
Of all the official residences
in Sheng'an,

708
00:41:10,000 --> 00:41:11,190
which hasn't changed hands
several times?

709
00:41:11,960 --> 00:41:12,510
Indeed.

710
00:41:12,920 --> 00:41:14,030
The highest-ranking officials,

711
00:41:14,360 --> 00:41:15,230
the great noble families,

712
00:41:15,760 --> 00:41:16,630
even members of the royal family...

713
00:41:17,320 --> 00:41:18,320
In Yu Cheng'an's eyes,

714
00:41:19,000 --> 00:41:20,280
they're nothing but meat
on a chopping block.

715
00:41:21,710 --> 00:41:22,320
As for me,

716
00:41:24,440 --> 00:41:25,320
I doubt he's even

717
00:41:25,710 --> 00:41:26,800
given me a second thought.

718
00:41:31,510 --> 00:41:32,440
What are you trying to tell me,
Your Highness?

719
00:41:35,710 --> 00:41:36,110
Yan Shang,

720
00:41:37,880 --> 00:41:39,110
I know what I want to accomplish.

721
00:41:40,760 --> 00:41:41,320
But...

722
00:41:42,280 --> 00:41:43,510
I don't know where to begin.

723
00:41:45,000 --> 00:41:46,070
Our strength is vastly unequal.

724
00:41:47,150 --> 00:41:48,920
That tiger sits high upon the mountain.

725
00:41:49,320 --> 00:41:50,510
I can't even get close to him.

726
00:41:51,360 --> 00:41:51,979
I don't want to pretend

727
00:41:52,021 --> 00:41:53,501
I have everything figured out
and deceive you.

728
00:41:54,800 --> 00:41:56,280
From now on, we stand or fall together.

729
00:41:57,320 --> 00:41:58,710
I owe you the truth.

730
00:42:02,480 --> 00:42:03,280
Thank you, Your Highness,

731
00:42:03,920 --> 00:42:05,070
for being honest with me.

732
00:42:07,030 --> 00:42:08,110
I took you on as my adviser

733
00:42:08,670 --> 00:42:10,550
precisely so you could give me advice.

734
00:42:14,510 --> 00:42:14,920
Your Highness,

735
00:42:16,480 --> 00:42:18,110
then let me tell you another story.

736
00:42:20,110 --> 00:42:20,440
All right.

737
00:42:24,340 --> 00:42:28,780
(Next Episode Preview)

738
00:42:29,190 --> 00:42:30,480
Your imperial exams are tomorrow.

739
00:42:30,800 --> 00:42:31,400
Are you nervous?

740
00:42:31,800 --> 00:42:33,150
That's not why I came here.

741
00:42:33,880 --> 00:42:34,880
Whether I pass or fail,

742
00:42:35,400 --> 00:42:35,960
it doesn't matter.

743
00:42:36,190 --> 00:42:37,960
Then how do you plan to make a living
in Sheng'an?

744
00:42:40,030 --> 00:42:42,320
By being your male favorite, of course.

745
00:42:45,280 --> 00:42:48,573
♪Be the ferry
where you wait for the sun♪

746
00:42:51,258 --> 00:42:56,174
♪Be the blue silk
that catches your tears♪

747
00:42:58,368 --> 00:43:04,213
♪Be the sleeve we held,
worn by dust and years♪

748
00:43:04,713 --> 00:43:09,939
♪Let's conspire to grow old together♪

749
00:43:12,708 --> 00:43:17,499
♪Let me be a captive beast
bound by the same lock as you♪

750
00:43:18,335 --> 00:43:24,414
♪- Through trails of mud and blood;
- let grief drown in your eyes♪

751
00:43:26,215 --> 00:43:29,365
♪Soar with the wind;
plunge into hellfire as one♪

752
00:43:29,365 --> 00:43:31,013
♪Burning bright as a song♪

753
00:43:31,065 --> 00:43:34,789
♪See how roses and green bamboo enchant♪

754
00:43:35,167 --> 00:43:39,833
♪Be the vow I make with all my heart♪

755
00:43:40,452 --> 00:43:44,493
♪If we say forever,
then forever it shall be♪

756
00:43:44,984 --> 00:43:47,099
♪Not a single hour less♪

757
00:43:47,139 --> 00:43:54,085
♪However deep the snow,
I'll wait if you're there♪

758
00:43:54,848 --> 00:43:58,301
♪We'll be gods above,
or wandering souls♪

759
00:43:58,481 --> 00:44:01,626
♪In heaven or the underworld,
you're all I need♪

760
00:44:02,065 --> 00:44:08,702
♪If we can stay, let's return
to the village of our first meeting♪

761
00:44:09,099 --> 00:44:11,137
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

762
00:44:11,137 --> 00:44:13,613
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

763
00:44:13,651 --> 00:44:16,120
♪You're the only one I need♪

764
00:44:16,324 --> 00:44:23,211
♪Sharp winds or fierce rain,
nothing can break us♪

765
00:44:23,523 --> 00:44:26,794
♪Be mine in this world;
be mine in this life♪

766
00:44:27,099 --> 00:44:30,272
♪My last untouched innocence♪

767
00:44:30,596 --> 00:44:34,022
♪If only we could return
to the village where we first met♪

768
00:44:34,255 --> 00:44:37,480
♪Stay by me; help me forget
the frozen dream of last night♪

769
00:44:37,811 --> 00:44:44,607
♪Fireflies glow, flowers kiss our lips;
just us, through dawn and dusk♪

770
00:44:44,976 --> 00:44:47,038
♪- May time be free of fear;
- boats rock♪

771
00:44:47,039 --> 00:44:49,542
♪- May time be free of pain;
- lights fade, seasons turn♪

772
00:44:49,589 --> 00:44:51,927
♪You're the only one I need♪

773
00:44:52,158 --> 00:44:58,993
♪By your side, through joy and pain,
is that eternity?♪

774
00:44:59,342 --> 00:45:00,960
♪Till fireworks flood the town♪

775
00:45:01,090 --> 00:45:02,886
♪Till the lake is still and clear♪

776
00:45:03,243 --> 00:45:06,260
♪You're the only one I need♪

777
00:45:06,300 --> 00:45:07,627
(No animals were harmed
or mistreated in production.)
